  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 146d4770de626e347adb2af1fed31305, type: 3}
  m_Name: EndingTV Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  IsThoughts: 0
  DialogueLines:
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "...I was terrified the whole time. \nI just couldn\u2019t pull myself
      together."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "And this is where my little story comes back in. \nI failed, so I had
      to destroy it."
  - ColorType: 9
    Text: Wait, destroy what? What are you talking about now?
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "Ugh, the story. I\u2019m not going to repeat it.\nI\u2019m sure the folks
      at home remember."
  - ColorType: 9
    Text: Ah, right, okay...
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: So, I killed it. Crushed it.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: But it came at a price.
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: "Sometimes, instead of facing something, \nwe desperately try to bury it
      and forget."
  - ColorType: 2
    Text: But that can be even more self-destructive...
